      "y": 210,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "### Fallback Controller\nInsforge → Supabase → SQLite\nTransparent failover",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1c2d3e4f5a60012",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -100,
      "y": 210,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "### Ops Logger\nAppend-only journal\nReplay + audit trail",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1c2d3e4f5a60013",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 210,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "### Decay Manager\nAuto-archive stale\nAccess-based scoring",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1c2d3e4f5a60020",
      "type": "group",
