      "type": "text",
      "x": -350,
      "y": 710,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "### Obsidian KG\n📝 markdown notes\n🔗 wikilink graph\n📊 bases views\n🖼️ canvas maps",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1c2d3e4f5a60032",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -50,
      "y": 710,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "### Projects Memory\n`memory/projects/`\nContexts · Decisions\nEntities · Sessions",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1c2d3e4f5a60033",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 250,
      "y": 710,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "### Long-Term Memory\npreferences · tech-stack\npatterns · people\n**Permanent, no decay**",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1c2d3e4f5a60034",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 550,
      "y": 710,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "### Archive\n`memory/archive/`\ndecayScore < 0.1\n**Cold storage**",
      "color": "1"
    }
